


### Local Environment
@base_url = http://localhost:8000

### Production Environment
@prod_url = https://your-public-url.up.railway.app


### Add Collateral
POST {{base_url}}/collateral/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrower_id": 1,
  "type": "vehicle",
  "value": 15000,
  "verification_status": "pending"
}

### List Collateral for Borrower
GET {{base_url}}/collateral/borrower/1

### Verify Collateral
POST {{base_url}}/collateral/verify/1
